            <td class="py-3 text-right font-semibold text-accent">88%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-themed">
            <td class="py-3 pr-4">Queries with gaps</td>
            <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-right">16 / 20</td>
            <td class="py-3 text-right font-semibold text-accent">4 / 20</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3 pr-4">Perfect queries</td>
            <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-right">4 / 20</td>
            <td class="py-3 text-right font-semibold text-accent">16 / 20</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-xs text-themed-muted mt-2 italic">Agent-driven retrieval tuning on a 52-document legal vault (949 memories). Baseline uses default settings (similarity, k=5). Tuned uses agent-selected strategies, weights, and k per query.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose text-themed">
      <p><strong>Failure analysis.</strong> The agent identified four systematic failure patterns:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Insufficient k</strong> (13/16 failures): k=5 returned only top-level results, missing supporting propositions. Fix: k=10.</li>
        <li><strong>Missing entity names in cues</strong> (5/16): Generic cues like "phishing attack" missed results that the embeddings associate with specific entities. Fix: include entity names in cues ("November 2024 phishing attack incident Ironclad response").</li>
        <li><strong>Wrong strategy for cross-entity queries</strong> (2/16): Similarity returns results from a single entity. Fix: analogical strategy with &alpha;=0.3.</li>
        <li><strong>Missing recency weighting for temporal queries</strong> (3/16): Default weights ignore temporal ordering. Fix: weights 0.3:0.5:0.2:0.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        The agent stored five generalized retrieval strategies as high-importance memories. These strategies are recalled at the start of subsequent conversations, making the tuning persistent across sessions.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Tuning cost.</strong> The full eval-tune-store loop completed in under 60 seconds of agent time (20 baseline queries + failure analysis + 16 tuned re-runs + 5 strategy stores).
      </p>

